Why: Give ordinary Chrome/Edge launches a lifecycle-owned isolated profile with a proven DevTools endpoint; open pages as inactive off-screen CDP windows placed behind the active window, keep the launch lock without restoring focus, disable Edge implicit account sign-in, and close the windowless browser after its last window.

